---
title: Quizzes | Vermont Football Officials
description: Study quizzes for Vermont high school football officials, drawn from the NFHS Football Rules Book and Case Book.
layout: layouts/main.pug
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---

h1 Quizzes
p.lead Study quizzes drawn from the NFHS Football Rules Book and Case Book. Each one ends with a fully cited answer key.
div.list-group
  //- Sorted by title, so numbered quizzes list in order as new ones are added.
  - var byTitle = function(a, b) { return String(a.data.title).localeCompare(String(b.data.title)); }
  each item in (collections.quizzes || []).slice().sort(byTitle)
    a.list-group-item.list-group-item-action(href=item.url)
      .row
        .col
          div= item.data.title
          if item.data.description
            small.text-secondary= item.data.description
        .col-auto.text-secondary.text-nowrap
          if item.data.level
            span= item.data.level
          if item.data.questions
            span  &middot; #{item.data.questions} questions
